OL,3,GNEWSAPoliceman 'abused role for sexual
OL,4,Apurposes'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police officer sucked a female
OL,7,Fcolleague's finger as part of an
OL,8,Funwanted pattern of sexual behaviour
OL,9,Ftowards women with whom he worked, a
OL,10,Fmisconduct panel heard.
OL,12,FThey also heard that former PC Robin
OL,13,FWhite, who retired from West Midlands
OL,14,FPolice in July ahead of the
OL,15,Fproceedings, asked another colleague in
OL,16,Fa police station in Walsall borough:
OL,17,F"When are we going to get our hot naked
OL,18,Fbodies together?"
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,360,350,200,160,0,100
