OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSAPoliceman 'abused role for sexual
OL,4,Apurposes'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhite's actions were deemed by the
OL,7,Fpanel to be "deliberate, intentional
OL,8,Fand targeted", and aimed at two
OL,9,Fcolleagues who were "both much younger
OL,10,Fin age and significantly less
OL,11,Fexperienced in role".
OL,13,FThe panel ruled that he abused his
OL,14,Fposition for sexual purposes and the
OL,15,Fbehaviour amounted to gross misconduct.
OL,16,FThe hearing concluded that White would
OL,17,Fhave been dismissed without notice if
OL,18,Fhe had still been a serving officer.
